{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Marisa  $Patchouli  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Marisa Kirisame",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the unchanging goddess."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >The Incident Stones were real, after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　　　　　Now I can take some time off of work, thanks to you. Thank you."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Hey, wait, bring Gensokyo back to its original state first!"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >It's all right. If I release my power, Gensokyo will return to its usual state."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　　　　　However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　　　　　How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >What? \"Depends on me\"? What do you mean...?"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Scarlet Devil Mansion."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A vampire’s mansion standing closely by the lakeside."
            ]
        },
        "47_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >It's true, that Incident Stone carries the mistress's power within itself."
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >See? Told ya."
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >However, I've never heard of her making anything like this."
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Ain't that like a huge deal?"
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >Indeed."
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Somebody must’ve stolen her magic, right? That’s straight-up copyright violation!"
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >No, that’s not the actual problem."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Wha...?"
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >Its existence means that something serious enough to require this incident's power will eventually happen."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Ah, uh..."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Actually, it ALREADY happened. That stone's what let me fix it."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >..."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　　　　　There you go again, with your fibs and leg-pulls..."
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >I'm dead serious! Thing is, I still don’t know where the stone came from so I came here."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >...Is that so? Why didn't I notice the incident myself then?"
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >That’s just it. That WAS the incident."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　　　　　It was an incident that erased change itself—",
                "not realizing anything was happening is part of it."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >I see, so there's only one purpose for the Incident Stone"
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Oh, yeah?"
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >It was created to save Gensokyo.",
                "<l$> Therefore, its creator must be an ally to Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　　　　　It's a simple reasoning, really."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >R-right."
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Well, whatever y'wanna call it, it was real.",
                "<l$> And I only caught on thanks to that stone."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >Could a hallucination-like incident like that really happen?"
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Patchouli  >Could I hold on to the stone? I'd like to study it."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >As if! I'll be doing the studyin'."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Marisa shared a few incident stones with Patchouli",
                "And the two decided to investigate them together."
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Studying the unknown is the favorite pastime of Magicians."
            ]
        },
        "41_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because they believe that a new future awaits within it."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It doesn't look like much has changed in Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "43_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Rather, the Gensokyo that doesn't resist change has returned."
            ]
        },
        "44_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ariya said that from here on, Gensokyo will change."
            ]
        },
        "45_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But Gensokyo has simply returned to how it always has been.",
                "That's all there is to it."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ending No.09: The Pride of the Magicians"
            ]
        }
    }
}